   "text": "Internal figures: company-wide thermal incidents were 8.1/100k last year; Ember 8 is 9.9/100k, above the discussed 8/100k recall trigger. Four thermal incidents went unreported to regulators. Ember 8’s 55°C sustained-heat failure rate is 3.9%; 81% of installed units support remote shut-off; suppress"
